        | Add an agent instance: What will change                                                          esc |
        | Step 6/8                                                                                             |
        |                                                                                                      |
        | The change to kitbag.toml, its commit title and how it will be published.                            |
        | ✗ kitbag.toml changed since the preview. Review the new preview.                                     |
        | Edit the shared manifest at /home/user/.local/share/kitbag/repo/kitbag.toml.                         |
        | Apply will attempt to commit and push this change to branch main. Every host reads it on its next    |
        | sync; Apply also syncs this machine.                                                                 |
        | Used only on laptop; other machines ignore this instance.                                            |
        | Local configuration directory: /home/user/.claude_3.                                                 |
        | These file effects describe this machine now. Apply rechecks the files; other hosts plan from their  |
        | own files.                                                                                           |
        | Create shared configuration at /home/user/.claude_3/CLAUDE.md.                                       |
        | Commit: chore(kitbag): add claude instance extra at ~/.claude_3                                      |
        | Publication route: direct push to main.                                                              |
        |                                                                                                      |
        | Changes to kitbag.toml:                                                                              |
        |   @@ kitbag.toml @@                                                                                  |
        |   +[targets.claude.instances.extra]                                                                  |
        |   +dir = "~/.claude_3"                                                                               |
        |   +hosts = ["laptop"]                                                                                |
